  <p>By using TotalRecalls, you agree to the following terms.</p>

  <h2>1. Local-only software</h2>
  <p>TotalRecalls is a Windows application that runs locally. We do not host your chats or session tokens.</p>

  <h2>2. Your responsibility</h2>
  <p>You must follow each AI provider's terms for your own account use. TotalRecalls simply exports conversations visible in your account.</p>

  <h2>3. No cloud storage</h2>
  <p>TotalRecalls does not provide cloud storage or cloud sync. Your exports remain on your PC.</p>

  <h2>4. One-time purchase</h2>
  <p>Your purchase grants you a license to use the current version of TotalRecalls. Future upgrades may be optional paid add-ons.</p>

  <h2>5. No warranty</h2>
